  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Equation of the lines</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfrac></math></p><p>We know that, shortest distance between the lines is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8801;</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
